            "text": "[CRITICAL] Solely Automated Credit Limits & US PII Data Egress\n\nRule: EU GDPR Article 22 & DPA Drift\n\nsrc/credit_scorer.py transmits raw customer names, identifiers, and postcodes directly to a US-hosted OpenAI endpoint without Presidio redaction, and executes solely automated credit-limit cuts with appeal_route_available=False.\n\nRemediation: Wrap input payload with local Microsoft Presidio anonymizer before inference.; Migrate model target to sovereign EU regional inference enclave."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
