            "text": "[HIGH] Customer Interaction AI Disclosure Omitted on Email and In-App Widget\n\nRule: EU AI Act Article 50(1) (Interaction Disclosure)\n\n2 of 4 chat entry points in src/routes.py (/v1/email-support/auto-respond and /v1/in-app-widget/instant-reply) fail to inform customers that they are conversing with an automated artificial intelligence system.\n\nRemediation: Add 'ai_disclosure: This message was generated by an AI assistant' to email templates.; Update in-app chat widget UI avatar and header to clearly designate bot identity."
